1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,950
Oyiga atigi yuz ming.

2
00:00:02,660 --> 00:00:06,120
Lekin jami qanchaligini hech kim aytmadi.

3
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:10,300
Usta, oyiga atigi yuz ming ekan!

4
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:11,840
Bemalol olaman.

5
00:00:13,410 --> 00:00:14,210
Necha oyga?

6
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:15,660
Jami qancha to'laysan?

7
00:00:17,230 --> 00:00:18,450
Yuz ming...

8
00:00:19,230 --> 00:00:20,670
o'n ikki oy...

9
00:00:21,670 --> 00:00:24,060
bir million ikki yuz ming.

10
00:00:25,530 --> 00:00:27,630
Bunga boshlang'ich to'lov,

11
00:00:27,970 --> 00:00:29,360
xizmat haqi qo'shilsa-chi?

12
00:00:30,980 --> 00:00:33,660
Sotuvchi faqat oylik to'lovni aytdi.

13
00:00:34,910 --> 00:00:36,430
Naqd narxini so'ramabman.

14
00:00:38,190 --> 00:00:41,030
Kichik bo'lingan narx katta summani yashiradi.

15
00:00:41,710 --> 00:00:43,440
Ikkalasini yonma-yon qo'y.

16
00:00:45,260 --> 00:00:46,310
Uchta savol ber.

17
00:00:47,150 --> 00:00:48,680
Naqd narxi qancha?

18
00:00:49,650 --> 00:00:51,240
Jami qancha to'layman?

19
00:00:52,110 --> 00:00:53,590
Kechiksam nima bo'ladi?

20
00:00:54,860 --> 00:00:55,900
Shoshilmayman.

21
00:00:55,900 --> 00:00:57,600
Avval hisoblab ko'raman.

22
00:00:59,120 --> 00:01:02,220
«Oyiga atigi» degandan keyin bitta savol qoladi:

23
00:01:02,840 --> 00:01:04,690
oxirida jami qancha?

24
00:01:06,040 --> 00:01:09,800
Narx yorlig'i yoki shartnoma suratini botimizga yuboring:

25
00:01:09,800 --> 00:01:10,800
@sahiychishopbot

26
00:01:10,800 --> 00:01:13,000
Jami qancha to'lashingizni hisoblab,

27
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:16,060
sotuvchiga qaysi savollarni berishni aytib beradi.

